<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 60px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>结论、局限与下一步</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#BFD0EA' }}>04 · 验证与结论</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 100, width: 640, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>已经做到的</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>① 20 条功能需求都有接口、页面与测试对应，范围外 9 项没有偷偷实现。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>② 半开区间口径从需求一路对到 SQL，首尾相接可用、部分重叠必拒。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>③ 并发抢同一时段只生成一条有效预约，失败一律返回 409 与真实占用时段。</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 640, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB', marginTop: 2 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>还不够的</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>状态码变更后页面级 12 步仍待复跑；浏览器兼容与干净机部署两项复现待补；性能只在 1000 条量级验证过。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 760, top: 100, width: 460, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>下一步</Text>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>页面链路收口</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>状态码变更后走完 12 步，确认冲突提示与令牌失效无退化</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>补齐两项复现</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>Edge 全流程、清空库后按 README 从零部署</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>数据量级验证</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>压测数据扩到万级，复核冲突查询与分页耗时</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 548, width: 1160, height: 72, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230' }}>这个系统的价值不在功能多少，而在每条规则都能从需求编号一路查到测试证据。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 660, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智能会议室管理系统 V1.0 · 第 4 组答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>09 / 10</Text>
